# ActionMenu popup, tested through a Choice on the Notifications Style row or Appearance page. Failed in batch 1: A2 (keys), A6 (look).
ipc panels settings notifications
wait 2
shot page
note Settings open on Notifications and Island; find the Style Choice (Material pill near 1325,580). Positions below are guesses: read from this shot.
ptr move 1325 580 sleep 300 glide 1325 580 100 click
wait 1
shot a1-open
note A1 list under the control, right edges lined up, 4 px gap, checked item marked (Material tertiary-container row, Glass accent fill with white text). Rust must not extend past the screen.
note A6 look: Style list rows 36 px (Material) / 28 px (Glass), as wide as the control (at least 200, at most 280 tall), opens with the chosen item lit. Batch 1 found Rust rows 44 px vs QML 36 px, menu 236 vs 200 wide, Glass checked item only a check mark without accent fill and no pointer highlight.
key -k Down
key -k Down
wait 1
shot a2-down
note A2 FAILED before: Down did not move the highlight (went to the Choice and toggled the list). Now two Downs must move the highlight two rows below the checked item and the menu stays open.
key -k Return
wait 1
shot a2-chosen
note The item two below the first usable one is chosen, the menu is closed and the Choice shows it.
ptr move 1325 580 sleep 300 glide 1325 580 100 click
wait 1
key -k Escape
wait 1
shot a2-esc
note A2 FAILED before: Escape did not close the menu. Now Escape closes only the menu, nothing chosen, the Settings window stays open.
ptr move 1325 580 sleep 300 glide 1325 580 100 click
wait 1
